# What''s this all about?

We launched in private, a white-label version of our platform and the response has been incredible.

Now, we wanted to open it up to a few more select organizations and:
 - Waive the Setup Fee 
 - Provide Signup at 30% our initial offering 
 - Give you a simple and easy way to setup and test a "NEW REVENUE STREAM"
 - Join our invite-only “STEM Leaders Community”

# What this means for you Vikas :D

With absolutely no upfront cost, you can test-launch a complete platform with our "STARTER Package" at only $200 per month.
 
 This includes:

A. The full, hyper-practical and efficient curriculum catalog we offer ( Game-Dev, Web-Dev & JS API/AI  Tracks.)
B. Modern on-boarding & complete LMS for students, classes and yes, and unlimited number of schools.
C. Auto-graded, custom curriculum is incredibly easy to build with our "Lesson-Builder Suite".
So if you have a course or want to build one, both are easier than ever.
D. And much more.

It''s hard to explain everything so I''m going to ask you to take two simple steps:

1. Watch one of the youtube video links I''ve added below. 
Decide if this is exact fit as a new revenue stream for your team.
( 2-3 mins )

2. Sign-up your org here ( No credit card required ) and reserve your brand handle: 
https://app.codetribe.com/auth/org 
( 2-3 mins )

 # Ok. But what is CodeTribe? ( And a glimpse of the future.)
 
 Right. Well,... until 2 months ago we would have told you we are a CS/Coding Edu Platform. 
 Buuuut we are actually leveraging our code-focused platform and modern LMS to allow for an ULTRA-flexible platform where ANY type of simulation, quiz, learning environment can be auto-graded.
 
 We''ve started running pilots to explore how far this LIMITLESS environment can go and we are super excited. Basically, virtually anything you can imagine teaching in an interactive form can be created seamlessly and auto-graded.
 
 Sorry, went off on a tangent there.
 
 At the moment, we''re a CS and Coding platform ( with a full LMS) oriented around kids and teens, but are quickly adding new and novel tools.

This is my PRIVATE email. Please respond to me directly here. I''ll answer as soon as I can.

Also would love to follow and learn more about your business and needs. So please connect with me on LinkedIn too. :)

Till soon,

Jonathan Novotny
co-Founder: CodeTribe

Linkedin: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jonathannovotny


